Package: reviewapp
Title: GMD Human Review Application
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("GPID", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "gpid@example.org")
Author: GPID Team [aut, cre]
Maintainer: GPID Team <gpid@example.org>
Description: A private, Git-backed Shiny for R application that lets GPID
    reviewers browse CVS drafts, inspect read-only YAML and guideline evidence,
    edit only the human Markdown body, and drive the governed review state
    machine (draft -> in-review -> approved, with a needs-revision loop)
    through role-gated actions. Review state, versions, and audit events are
    stored on a dedicated protected review branch via a GitHub App identity.
    Built with the Golem framework for production-grade Shiny applications.
